   \texttt{macrocode} environments in \texttt{doc} implementation text
are typeset
in the \cs{small} font size. The \texttt{dtxmacrofont} package allows
the package author to
select the font size through four declarations and reimplements
\cs{MacroFont} and \cs{AltMacroFont} to typeset \texttt{macrocode}
in the selected font size.
